      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What does this diagram prove? Upload and ingest are separate, inspectable steps (FR-009/012) --\na failed ingestion never crashes the request or leaks internals, and re-triggering an already-\ningested document is a no-op (idempotent, same philosophy as CLI ingestion's FR-002).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What does this diagram prove? Upload and ingest are separate, inspectable steps (FR-009/012) --\na failed ingestion never crashes the request or leaks internals, and re-triggering an already-\ningested document is a no-op (idempotent, same philosophy as CLI ingestion's FR-002).",
